## 예제

### 예제 1: Hello World

```miniscript
println("Hello, World!");
```

실행:
```bash
node main.js examples/hello.ms
```

### 예제 2: 피보나치

```miniscript
fn fibonacci(n) {
  if (n <= 1) {
    return n;
  }
  return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2);
}

for (let i = 0; i < 10; i = i + 1) {
  println("fibonacci(" + toString(i) + ") = " + toString(fibonacci(i)));
}
```

### 예제 3: 합계 계산

```miniscript
fn sum(n) {
  let total = 0;
  for (let i = 1; i <= n; i = i + 1) {
    total = total + i;
  }
  return total;
}

println("Sum of 1 to 100: " + toString(sum(100)));
```

